<meta type=article title="Inline SVG figure">
</meta>

<section | A figure>

A captioned, numbered inline `<svg>` exports as a self-contained JATS
`<graphic>` whose `xlink:href` is a base64 data URI carrying the full SVG.

<svg #fig:circle viewBox="0 0 100 100" caption="A blue circle." |
  <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="blue" />
>
